  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tCapium Pay\n\t\tHelp Guide\n\n### How a user can make a payment?\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Wed, 5 Apr, 2023 at  5:07 PM\n\n\t\tTo make payment within Capium Pay.\n\nNavigation: Email\n\nFollowing the navigation process, a user is able to navigate to a pay portal by clicking the link.\n\nOnce performed, a user will be redirected to a pay portal where the full overview can be seen. To proceed with the payment, a user is required to click the 'CapiumPay' blue icon. \n\nOnce performed, a user is able to fill in the required details and proceed with the payment. \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
